abstract: >-
  Heuristic agents lifted into the OEE calculus of execution and run on ZTES: every step of a
  method is a candidate proposed by an ontology, admitted by a criterion and appended to one
  record, and every run replays. Cooperative variable neighborhood search on the travelling
  salesman problem, an adaptive agent, an exact reference (CPTL) and k-SAT as evolutive consensus.
  Executable supplement to a paper in preparation.
keywords: [execution calculus, metaheuristics, variable neighborhood search, travelling salesman problem, SAT, clause learning, evolutive consensus, replay]
